# Copy to .env (never commit a real key). Read server-side only; never sent to the browser.
# With a key: Panel 02 uses live Claude calls for intention extraction and negotiation narrative.
# Without a key: the app runs in the clearly labelled Offline Demonstration Mode (rule parser + template text).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional model override
PI_LLM_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
